# UHH Discord Website Status Bot

This optional Node.js bot checks your GitHub Pages website and sends a Discord webhook message when the site changes from UP to DOWN or DOWN to UP.

## Setup

1. Install Node.js 18 or newer.
2. Create a Discord webhook in the channel where you want status alerts.
3. Copy `.env.example` to `.env`.
4. Edit `.env` with your website URL and webhook URL.
5. Run:

```bash
npm install
npm start
```

Keep this running on your PC, a Raspberry Pi, or a free server. Do not upload your real `.env` file to GitHub.
